<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>For Tangii ♡ (Blue Edition)</title>
  <!-- Main Blue Theme Fonts -->
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@400;500;600&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,500;1,400&family=Quicksand:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      /* Blue Theme Color Palette */
      --bg: #F0F8FF;             /* AliceBlue - Softest base */
      --card-bg: #FFFFFF;
      --text-main: #203A5F;      /* Deep, clear blue for text */
      --text-muted: #627F9E;     /* Muted blue-grey */
      --blue-primary: #87CEEB;   /* SkyBlue - Lighter primary accents */
      --blue-soft: #E1F0FF;      /* Very soft pastel blue */
      --blue-accent: #3498DB;    /* A bit stronger, calming blue */
      --border: #C6E0F7;         /* Soft blue-sky border */
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg);
      /* Blue background pattern - subtle clouds */
      background-image: 
        radial-gradient(#EBF5FF 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 20px 20px;
      color: var(--text-main);
      font-family: 'Quicksand', sans-serif;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 480px;
      width: 100%;
      margin: 0 auto;
      position: relative;
    }

    /* Sticker Styles - Revamped for Blue */
    .sticker {
      position: absolute;
      background: #FFF;
      border: 2px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--blue-accent);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(52, 152, 219, 0.1);
      user-select: none;
      z-index: 10;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
    }

    .sticker-top-right {
      top: -15px;
      right: -10px;
      transform: rotate(8deg);
    }

    .sticker-bottom-left {
      bottom: -10px;
      left: -10px;
      transform: rotate(-6deg);
    }

    header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .sub-title {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      color: var(--blue-accent);
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 2.3rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--text-main);
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 2px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(135, 206, 235, 0.1);
      position: relative;
    }

    /* Music Player Card - Linear Blue Gradient */
    .music-card {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFF, var(--blue-soft));
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
      border-color: #A3D4FF; /* Slightly warmer blue border */
    }

    .music-info {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .album-art {
      width: 55px;
      height: 55px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: #EBF5FF; /* Subtle light blue inside */
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: var(--blue-accent);
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
    }

    .song-details h3 {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--text-main);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .song-details p {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    /* Customized Audio Player - for consistency */
    audio {
      width: 100%;
      height: 36px;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
    audio::-webkit-media-controls-panel {
      background-color: #EBF5FF;
    }
    audio::-webkit-media-controls-current-time-display,
    audio::-webkit-media-controls-time-remaining-display {
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .main-letter p {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #384F6F; /* Deep-toned blue for readability */
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .main-letter p:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      margin: 30px 0 16px 0;
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--text-main);
    }

    .accordion-item {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 2px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .accordion-header {
      padding: 16px 20px;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--text-main);
    }

    .accordion-header:hover {
      background-color: var(--blue-soft);
    }

    .accordion-icon {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
      color: var(--blue-accent);
    }

    .accordion-content {
      max-height: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: max-height 0.3s ease, padding 0.3s ease;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #4D6688; /* Blue-grey for content */
      background: #FDFEFE;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .accordion-item.active .accordion-content {
      max-height: 200px;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .accordion-item.active .accordion-icon {
      transform: rotate(180deg);
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 36px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--blue-accent);
      font-weight: 600;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <div class="sub-title">✨ A Little Blue Space For You ✨</div>
      <h1>To My Dearest Tangii</h1>
    </header>

    <!-- Music Player Card (Blue) -->
    <div class="card music-card">
      <div class="music-info">
        <div class="album-art">🎧</div>
        <div class="song-details">
          <h3>Nothing's Gonna Hurt You Baby</h3>
          <p>Cigarettes After Sex</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <audio controls loop>
        <source src="https://ia801503.us.archive.org/15/items/cigarettes-after-sex-nothings-gonna-hurt-you-baby/Cigarettes%20After%20Sex%20-%20Nothing%27s%20Gonna%20Hurt%20You%20Baby.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
        Your browser does not support the audio element.
      </audio>
    </div>

    <!-- Letter Card with Blue Stickers -->
    <div class="card main-letter">
      <div class="sticker sticker-top-right">💎 Purest love</div>
      <p>My Tangii,</p>
      <p>I wanted to build this cozy, calm little corner just to remind you of how deeply you are loved and supported every single day.</p>
      <p>No matter where life takes us, what challenges come your way, or how tired you feel, please remember that I am right here beside you. You never have to carry everything on your own.</p>
      <p>I believe in you, in your dreams, and in who you are. I am so proud to be your partner, today and always.</p>
      <div class="sticker sticker-bottom-left">☁️ Dream together</div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-title">Open When You Need Me</div>

    <div class="accordion-item">
      <div class="accordion-header" onclick="toggleAccordion(this)">
        <span>🌊 Open when you're feeling overwhelmed...</span>
        <span class="accordion-icon">▼</span>
      </div>
      <div class="accordion-content">
        Take a deep breath, Tangii. Like a calm ocean. Pause for a moment. You are doing enough, and you are more than capable. Step away if you need to—I'm here waiting to listen whenever you're ready.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="accordion-item">
      <div class="accordion-header" onclick="toggleAccordion(this)">
        <span>✨ Open when you doubt yourself...</span>
        <span class="accordion-icon">▼</span>
      </div>
      <div class="accordion-content">
        Remember how far you've come. I see your effort, your heart, and your dedication every day. Even when you can't see your own strength, I hold enough belief in you for both of us.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="accordion-item">
      <div class="accordion-header" onclick="toggleAccordion(this)">
        <span>💌 Open when you miss me...</span>
        <span class="accordion-icon">▼</span>
      </div>
      <div class="accordion-content">
        Close your eyes for a second. I am holding you close in my heart. Send me a quick message or call—I am always here for my Tangii.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="accordion-item">
      <div class="accordion-header" onclick="toggleAccordion(this)">
        <span>💖 Open when you need a gentle reminder...</span>
        <span class="accordion-icon">▼</span>
      </div>
      <div class="accordion-content">
        I love you. Unconditionally, wholeheartedly, and consistently. You are my home, and I will always support you in everything you do.
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
      Made with endless love, just for you ♡
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    function toggleAccordion(header) {
      const item = header.parentElement;
      item.classList.toggle('active');
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
